  <lyrics>
    <verse name="v1">
      <lines>
      As You have promised, Lord, today,<br/>
      You are letting Your servant go away in peace.<br/>
      May eyes have seen You in broad daylight<br/>
      before all nations, planning salvation.<br/>
      Light of revelation for the nations,<br/>
      and glory of Your people Israel.
      </lines>
    </verse>
  </lyrics>
